nt="v1"><span begin="23.792" end="24.336">谁为</span><span begin="24.336" end="24.518">了</span><span begin="24.518" end="25.173">几口</span><span begin="25.173" end="25.497">饭</span> <span begin="25.579" end="26.051">生了</span><span begin="26.051" end="26.617">非分</span><span begin="26.617" end="26.930">之</span><span begin="26.930" end="27.517">想</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="27.397" end="27.914">(生了</span><span begin="27.914" end="28.168">非</span><span begin="28.168" end="28.451">分</span><span begin="28.451" end="28.816">之</span><span begin="28.816" end="29.333">想)</span></span></p></div><div begin="30.129" end="43.731" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="30.129" end="37.408" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.129" end="30.742">谁</span><span begin="30.742" end="31.546">是</span><span begin="31.546" end="31.813">白</span><span begin="31.813" end="32.197">羊</span> <span begin="33.808" end="34.266">谁</span><span begin="34.266" end="35.030">是</span><span begin="35.030" end="35.354">灰</span><span begin="35.354" end="35.904">狼</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="32.131" end="32.554">(谁</span><span begin="32.554" end="33.142">是</span><span begin="33.142" end="33.620">白</span><span begin="33.620" end="33.802">羊</span> <span begin="35.658" end="36.060">谁</span><span begin="36.205" end="36.859">是</span><span begin="36.859" end="37.102">灰</span><span begin="37.102" end="37.408">狼)</span></span></p><p begin="37.416" end="41.811" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.416" end="37.914">谁来</span><span begin="37.914" end="38.317">判断</span><span begin="38.317" end="38.662">谁</span><span begin="38.662" end="38.904">能</span><span begin="38.904" end="39.158">被</span><span begin="39.158" end="39.467">原</span><span begin="39.467" end="39.941">谅</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="39.732" end="40.210">(判断</span><span begin="40.210" end="40.687">谁能</span><span begin="40.687" end="41.343">被原</span><span begin="41.343" end="41.811">谅)</span></span></p><p b